---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | SaveFileTool"
  description="Understand the limited browser storage used by SaveFileTool."
>
  <section class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-blue max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8">
        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> September 29, 2026
      </p>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">1. Current Cookie Use</h2>
        <p>
          The current public build does not set third-party analytics, advertising, or cross-site
          ad cookies. It also does not include a first-party tracking beacon.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">2. Browser Storage</h2>
        <p>
          SaveFileTool may use local browser storage for functionality you request, including theme
          preference, optional local edit history, and optional edit templates.
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-6">
          <table class="min-w-full bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700">
                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">Storage</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">Purpose</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">Control</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Theme preference</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Remember light or dark mode.</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Clear browser site data.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Local file handoff</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Move a file from the home chooser to the editor inside the same browser.</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Expires automatically or can be cleared with browser site data.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Optional local history</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Keep browser-only copies for repeat edits after you enable it.</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Disable and clear from the editor.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Optional templates</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Save reusable field edits on this device.</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Delete templates in the editor or clear browser site data.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">3. Managing Storage</h2>
        <p>
          You can clear site data from your browser settings. Clearing site data removes local
          history, templates, and preferences stored for SaveFileTool on that device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">4. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:privacy@savefiletool.com" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline"
            >privacy@savefiletool.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Cookie Policy",
      "url": "https://savefiletool.com/cookie-policy",
      "description": "Cookie Policy for SaveFileTool.",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-09-29",
      "specialty": "LegalDocument"
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
